  "description": "How do baby animals grow? Guess the baby with Milo the bluebird, then find out: bear cubs are born in a den in the middle of winter, a foal usually stands up within an hour of being born, and a baby elephant cannot drink with its trunk yet, so it kneels down, while the whole family helps look after it.\nAn interactive animal lesson for kids ages 2-6, with questions to answer, counting, actions to copy, quick checks and a quiz at the end.\n\nThe Animated Zoo makes gentle, colorful videos for little learners. New videos every day! Made with care for ages 2-6. Characters and visuals are animated with the help of AI tools and reviewed for kid safety before publishing.",
